Killers of the Flower Moon is a crime, history,
drama film directed by Martin Scorsese.

3
00:22:04,285 --> 00:22:10,285
When oil is discovered in 1920s Oklahoma under Osage Nation land, the Osage people
are murdered one by one—until the FBI steps in to unravel the mystery.

4
