10
01:13:34,285 --> 01:13:40,285
Killers of the Flower Moon is a 2023 American epic anti-Western crime drama film directed by Martin
Scorsese, who co-wrote the screenplay with Eric Roth, based on the 2017 nonfiction book.

11
01:20:55,714 --> 01:21:01,714
It stars Leonardo DiCaprio, Robert De Niro, and Lily Gladstone.

12
01:28:17,142 --> 01:28:23,142
Set in 1920s Oklahoma, it focuses on a series of murders of Osage members and
relations in the Osage Nation after oil was discovered on tribal land.

13
01:35:38,571 --> 01:35:44,571
The tribal members had retained mineral rights on their reservation, but a
corrupt local political boss sought to steal the wealth.

14
01:43:00,000 --> 01:43:06,000
It is the sixth feature film collaboration between Scorsese and DiCaprio, the tenth between Scorsese and De Niro, and the eleventh and final
between Scorsese and composer Robbie Robertson, who died two months before the film's release and to whom the film is dedicated.

15
01:50:21,428 --> 01:50:27,428
Development began in March 2016 when Imperative
Entertainment won the adaptation rights to the book.

16
01:57:42,857 --> 01:57:48,857
Scorsese and DiCaprio were attached to the film in 2017, with
production expected to begin in early 2018.

17
02:05:04,285 --> 02:05:10,285
Following several pushbacks and delays due to the COVID-19 pandemic, production was scheduled to start in February
2021, with Apple Studios confirmed to finance and distribute the film alongside Paramount Pictures.

18
02:12:25,714 --> 02:12:31,714
Principal photography ultimately took place between April and
October 2021 in Osage and Washington counties, Oklahoma.

19
02:19:47,142 --> 02:19:53,142
With its $200–215 million budget, it was reportedly the largest
amount ever spent on a film shoot in Oklahoma.

20
02:27:08,571 --> 02:27:14,571
Killers of the Flower Moon premiered at the 76th
Cannes Film Festival on May 20, 2023.

21
02:34:30,000 --> 02:34:36,000
It was theatrically released in the United States on October 20, by
Paramount Pictures, before streaming on Apple TV+ in January 2024.

22
02:41:51,428 --> 02:41:57,428
The film grossed $158 million and received critical acclaim.

23
02:49:12,857 --> 02:49:18,857
It won Best Film at the National Board of Review and was named one of
the top-ten films of 2023 by the American Film Institute.

24
02:56:34,285 --> 02:56:40,285
It was also nominated for ten Academy Awards (including Best Picture), seven Golden Globe Awards (including Best
Motion Picture), nine British Academy Film Awards (including Best Film), and three SAG Awards.

25
03:03:55,714 --> 03:04:01,714
For her performance, Gladstone won the Golden Globe and Screen Actors Guild Award for Best
Actress, and she received a nomination for the Academy Award for Best Actress.

26
03:11:17,142 --> 03:11:23,142
The film explores themes of husband wife relationship, based
on novel or book, war veteran, fbi, greed.

27
03:18:38,571 --> 03:18:44,571
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
